<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Mitac March sales up 5.93 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Mitac March sales up 5.93 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitac International Corp, one of Taiwan's leading computer makers, said on Wednesday that its March sales revenue rose 5.93 percent to T$1.299 billion from T$1.226 billion in March 1996.</p>
<p>Between January and March, Mitac's sales revenue fell 9.62 percent to T$3.399 billion from T$3.761 billion a year ago, a company statement said.</p>
<p>The statement did not give profit figures.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
